===Head to the Goethe Hotel for your appointment{{subst:void|<!--201140202-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Hotel Lobby|update|Serval invited you to have afternoon tea together at the Goethe Hotel with a clumsy excuse. After all, there is no such thing as a free lunch &mdash; You immediately realize that there is more to it.<br />No matter what, head to the Goethe Hotel and chat with Serval &mdash; Who can resist a free cup of coffee? At the very least, Serval is one of the few people in Belobog that you call your friends, no?}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Serval)
:'''Serval:''' ...Where did they get to?
:'''Serval:''' Ah, speak of the devil! I was just wondering when you might show up, hehe.
